         a. [Case name]: [how it illustrates the rule]
         b. [Exception or limitation]
      2. [Next rule]
```

**Rules-only (bar prep style):**
```
## [Topic]
- [Rule]. [Case cite].
- Exception: [rule]. [Case cite].
```

**Flowchart-adjacent:**
```
[Topic] → Is [element 1] met?
  YES → Is [element 2] met?
    YES → [Result]
    NO → [Different result]
  NO → [No claim]
```

Match theirs.

