| `disablePreview` | `boolean` | `false` | Skip audio/video preview |
| `audioPanelAlwaysOpen` | `boolean` | `false` | Keep audio panel open |
| `showPureSharingContent` | `boolean` | `false` | Prevent overlays on shared content |
